sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Manager
    participant C as AI client (in-app or external MCP client)
    participant M as MCP server
    participant P as Policy engine (ReBAC + field rules)
    participant D as Domain command API
    participant A as Approval inbox
    participant L as Audit ledger
    U->>C: "Approve Priya's leave and move her shift to Friday"
    C->>M: OAuth 2.1 token (user-delegated, scoped: time.write)
    M->>P: check(agent on behalf of U, leave:123, approve)
    P-->>M: allowed (U manages Priya)
    M->>D: approveLeave(123) with idempotency key
    D-->>M: ok, leave approved
    M->>P: check(agent on behalf of U, shift:456, update)
    P-->>M: allowed but risky (creates overtime)
    M->>A: create pending action with diff + reason
    A-->>U: confirm card: "+2h overtime, cost 1,450 INR"
    U->>A: confirm
    A->>D: updateShift(456)
    D->>L: append events (actor = agent, on behalf of = U, prompt hash)
    M-->>C: structured result + links
